  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/WeS8L88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"982\" height=\"197\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2755185\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 論壇</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a>&nbsp;- <a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>自然指南針是一款實用道具，可讓您在世界任何地方搜尋生物群系的所在位置並查看相關資訊。如果您正在尋找用於定位建築的指南針，不妨查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">探險家指南針</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>手持自然指南針右鍵點擊將開啟生物群系選擇介面，您可在此搜尋特定生物群系或查看其資訊</li>\n<li>按住 Shift 鍵並右鍵點擊可重置指南針狀態</li>\n<li>當指南針未指向任何生物群系時，它會指向世界重生點</li>\n<li>相容於所有生物群系（包含原版與模組新增）</li>\n<li>您可以在設定檔中調整黑名單生物群系、最大搜尋距離等選項</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>截圖</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rhz4gLR.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p><em>找到的生物群系相關資訊會顯示在螢幕上方（HUD）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GTSAfqv.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p><em>生物群系選擇介面</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vjsdZZ4.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p><em>生物群系資訊介面</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/175k4oE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p><em>樹苗與原木會使用礦物字典進行判定。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>整合包</strong></span></p>\n<p>是的，您可以在您的整合包中使用此模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支援開發</strong></span></p>\n<p>如果您喜歡這個模組並希望支持該專案，歡迎透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f256087%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dNotes%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal 捐贈</a>。非常感謝您的支持！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>贊助商</strong></span></p>\n<p>本專案由 BisectHosting 贊助。如果您正在尋找遊戲伺服器主機，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">歡迎瀏覽他們的託管方案</a>，並在結帳時使用優惠碼 <em>Chaos</em> 即可享有首月七五折優惠！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
